# Key delivery under load: play, grid-record, toggle 12 trigs on and off x3.
# Avoids steps 1/5/9/13 (often already trigged). Run --read-only on a card
# with a project; the first PLAY right after boot can need a re-tap even on
# stock builds (boot readiness, not key loss).
# Every verified tap that has to be redone prints "re-tap (key lost)".
